flowchart TB
    Client[Frontend Angular / Cliente HTTP]
    Apache[Apache HTTP Server / Reverse Proxy]
    Tomcat[Tomcat 10 / Spring Boot Runtime]

    subgraph API[API Layer - Controllers]
        AuthC[AuthController]
        MaestroC[MaestroController]
        FormularioC[FormularioController]
        GestionC[GestionController]
        CasosC[CasosController]
    end

    subgraph Security[Security Layer]
        SecCfg[SecurityConfig]
        JwtFilter[JwtAuthenticationFilter]
        JwtSvc[JwtService]
        UserDetails[UsuarioDetailsService]
        AuthSvc[AuthService]
    end

    subgraph App[Application Layer - Services]
        WorkflowSvc[FormularioWorkflowService]
        MaestroSvc[MaestroService]
    end

    subgraph Data[Data Layer]
        Repos[Spring Data Repositories]
        Entities[Entidades JPA\nUsuario, Caso, Persona, Campus, etc.]
        PG[(PostgreSQL)]
    end

    subgraph Docs[Docs Layer]
        OpenApi[OpenApiConfig]
        Swagger[Swagger UI /api/v1/swagger-ui.html]
    end

    Client --> Apache --> Tomcat
    Tomcat --> API

    AuthC --> AuthSvc
    AuthSvc --> JwtSvc
    AuthSvc --> UserDetails

    MaestroC --> MaestroSvc
    FormularioC --> WorkflowSvc
    GestionC --> WorkflowSvc
    CasosC --> WorkflowSvc

    JwtFilter --> JwtSvc
    JwtFilter --> UserDetails
    SecCfg --> JwtFilter

    MaestroSvc --> Repos
    WorkflowSvc --> Repos
    UserDetails --> Repos

    Repos --> Entities --> PG

    OpenApi --> Swagger
    API -.documentado por.-> OpenApi
